# Film titles (the film itself is only built with the showcase feature)
plotty.film.title = Plotty: a town on your server
plotty.film.found = A game master founds a city: first its plaza, with a well and the city stone
plotty.film.grow = Then streets, a market square and plots, on a grid of 16-block cells
plotty.film.undo = One build at a time, and every build can be undone
plotty.film.houses = Houses from structgen go up on free plots
plotty.film.claim = Every player can claim a small and a normal plot; moderators hand out large ones
plotty.film.show = Your plots in green, others' in blue, free ones in white
plotty.film.stall = A market stall: crates, counters, posts, an awning and its register
plotty.film.setup = Its owner sets up to eight offers, in items or Golden Woof
plotty.film.market = On the market square, places for stalls are rented for 1, 7 or 30 days
plotty.film.trade = Anyone can trade at a stall, even while its owner is away
plotty.film.woof = Golden Woof isn't an item: your balance shows beside your inventory
plotty.film.end = Plotty: a whitelist, a safe spawn, cities, plots and markets
